{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34436","headline":"和访寂上人不遇 · 陆龟蒙","name":"和访寂上人不遇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芭蕉霜後石栏荒，林下无人闭竹房。\n经抄未成抛素几，锡环应撼过寒塘。\n蒲团爲拂浮埃散，茶器空怀碧饽香。\n早晚却还宗炳社，夜深风雪对禅牀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34436.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34436","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}